# draft.part -- An outline with a draft, joined to a straight one, with a hole
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# An L with round and sharp corners: straight from 0 to 10, then leaning
# in by 1 degree to 30, so that every side turns at y = 10, the lines to
# planes at a slant and the arcs to cones.  A hole along x goes through
# both: it leaves the plane wall in a circle and the wall at a slant in
# an ellipse.

profile p along y 0 0 2 30 0 3 30 20 0 20 20 2 20 8 2 0 8 1
extrude a from 0 to 10 p
extrude b from 10 to 30 p draft 1
union s a b
circle c along x 10 14 6
extrude h from 15 to 31 c
cut u s h
